"Safari doesn't tell extensions what content blockers block. To get a count, wBlock copies the filter rules that block one domain or a path on it (like ||example.com^ or ||example.com/ads/) into Safari's declarativeNetRequest engine, and Safari counts how often they match. Rules that can match any domain or only apply on certain sites aren't counted, and neither are hidden page elements. Safari also limits how many rules an extension can have, so with many filter lists some are left out. Blocking doesn't change, but the number will probably be a lot lower than you're used to. It counts requests, so a tracker that loads five times counts as five." = "Safari 不會告訴延伸功能內容阻擋器阻擋了什麼。為了取得數量，wBlock 會將阻擋某個網域或其上某個路徑的過濾規則（例如 ||example.com^ 或 ||example.com/ads/）複製到 Safari 的 declarativeNetRequest 引擎中，由 Safari 計算它們的符合次數。可能符合任何網域、或只在特定網站生效的規則不會計入，隱藏的頁面元素也不會。Safari 也限制了一個延伸功能能擁有的規則數量，所以過濾列表較多時會有一部分被捨棄。阻擋效果不變，但這個數字很可能比你習慣的低很多。計算的是請求次數，所以一個載入五次的追蹤器會計為五次。";
