"Sites include their subdomains. Use * for any top-level domain, as in amazon.*. Reload the page after a change." = "網站包含其子網域。使用 * 比對任何頂層網域，例如 amazon.*。變更後請重新載入頁面。";
"Status" = "狀態";
"Filter list too large to convert" = "過濾列表太大，無法轉換";
"Too many rules to convert" = "要轉換的規則太多";
"This list is too large for wBlock to convert. Lists can have up to %@ rules, and Safari holds 150,000 per blocker." = "此列表太大，wBlock 無法轉換。每個列表最多可有 %@ 條規則，Safari 每個阻擋器可容納 150,000 條。";
"This list has %@ rules, more than wBlock can convert. Lists can have up to %@ rules, and Safari holds 150,000 per blocker." = "此列表有 %@ 條規則，超出 wBlock 可轉換的數量。每個列表最多可有 %@ 條規則，Safari 每個阻擋器可容納 150,000 條。";
"The enabled lists have %@ rules, more than wBlock can convert at once (%@). Turn off some lists and apply again." = "已啟用的列表共有 %@ 條規則，超出 wBlock 一次可轉換的數量（%@）。請關閉部分列表後重新套用。";

/* 4.0 upgrade notice */
"Welcome to wBlock 4.0" = "歡迎使用 wBlock 4.0";
"Got It" = "好";
"Why things changed" = "為什麼會有這些改變";
"wBlock used AdGuard's converter to turn filter lists into Safari rules. It skips rules written only for uBlock Origin. That meant many uBO lists didn't work fully in wBlock." = "wBlock 過去使用 AdGuard 的轉換器，把過濾清單轉換為 Safari 規則。轉換器會略過只為 uBlock Origin 撰寫的規則，所以很多 uBO 清單在 wBlock 中無法完整運作。";
"A new engine" = "全新引擎";
"I built a new engine that reads lists like uBlock Origin. wBlock starts from uBO's lists now. Your enabled AdGuard lists were swapped for matching uBO lists." = "我開發了一個新引擎，可以像 uBlock Origin 一樣讀取清單。wBlock 現在以 uBO 的清單為起點。你啟用的 AdGuard 清單已換成對應的 uBO 清單。";
"What stays the same" = "維持不變的部分";
"Your custom lists, userscripts, Element Zapper rules and site settings are unchanged. AdGuard lists are still in Filters if you want them back." = "你的自訂清單、使用者腳本、Element Zapper 規則和網站設定都沒有改變。如果你想換回 AdGuard 清單，它們仍在「過濾器」中。";
"If a site breaks" = "如果網站出了問題";
"Turn wBlock off for that site using the wBlock button in Safari. Then let me know on [GitHub](https://github.com/0xCUB3/wBlock/issues)." = "在 Safari 中點按 wBlock 按鈕，為該網站關閉 wBlock。然後請在 [GitHub](https://github.com/0xCUB3/wBlock/issues) 上告訴我。";
"Duplicate Filter Lists" = "重複的過濾清單";
"Remove Copy" = "移除副本";
"Keep Both" = "全部保留";
"\"%@\" has almost the same rules as \"%@\", so wBlock is applying them twice. Remove the copy?" = "「%1$@」與「%2$@」的規則幾乎相同，因此 wBlock 會重複套用這些規則。要移除副本嗎？";
